---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout title="项目 — YOURSITE">
  <main>
    <h1>项目</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:2rem">我做过的一些项目，点击查看详情。</p>

    <a href="/my-blog/projects/sn-workorder" class="project-card">
      <h3>SN 售后工单系统</h3>
      <p>基于微信小程序的售后工单全流程管理系统，支持工单创建/分配/跟踪、客户管理、数据看板、消息通知，配套 PC 后台管理端。</p>
      <div class="tags">
        <span class="tag">微信小程序</span>
        <span class="tag">Node.js</span>
        <span class="tag">Express</span>
        <span class="tag">MySQL</span>
        <span class="tag">ECharts</span>
        <span class="tag">企业级</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    <div class="project-card" style="opacity:0.5">
      <h3>更多项目即将添加</h3>
      <p>正在整理中</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
